WEBVTT

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:06.560
Come here, Lulu!

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.030
Come here!

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.820
Lulu, that tickles!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:17.700
Lulu!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:01.760
Listen, the level 7 exam is much more difficult than the level 9 and level 8 ones. So do your best, okay?

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.640
So jus' what's so different from the earlier ones?

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.140
Level 7 apprentices have the ability to talk to plants.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:14.310
That kind of magic exists? How wonderful! I could talk to the flowers in the garden.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:14.980
Really?

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:19.490
I'd rather talk to animals.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:23.190
As you go up in levels, you'll be able to do that eventually.

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:24.820
Really? Cool!

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:27.960
That's why you must pass the level 7 exam!

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.580
Don't Use That! The Forbidden Magic.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:41.360
Magic spheres!

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.180
Okay!

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.970
We'll pass the exam for sure!

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:44.640
Yeah!

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.850
Okay, let's get going to the Witch World.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.270
Th-This is bad! Everyone, hide!

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.380
Why?

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:52.940
Why do you have to ask!?

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:58.650
~ Why are you hiding? ~

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:00.580
De...Dela.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.120
Don't appear out of the blue like that!

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:06.670
Oh, I can't suddenly come and visit you?

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.080
Well, that's not what I mean...

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.500
So anyway, what do you want today?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.890
That's not the way to treat me, Majo Rika.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:19.510
I'm here to collect last month's payment. You gotta pay me.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.340
Is that so? I completely forgot about that.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:27.070
Dela, I'm sorry, but we're just about to go out.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:29.930
So it you would come back another day for my payment...

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.690
Wh-what are you doing?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:36.860
Before you go, ~ please pay your bills! ~

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.530
Th-that's...

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.090
You'd be better off telling the truth.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:45.680
I guess so. Dela, since the store is closed now...

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:46.490
Then...

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:49.120
Then...

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:54.880
Could you give me an extension on the payment? I'll definitely pay you next time.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.170
Even if you say that...

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.020
Please, please.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:03.150
Perhaps if you got me lots of tea.

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:05.260
Lala, get some tea for Dela-san!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.180
Sure, coming right up!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.810
Lately my neck has been really stiff...

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:15.560
That feels great...

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:21.110
Majo Rika, what about our exam? We're gonna be late.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.570
I have no choice. You girls just go ahead without me.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:26.070
~ Leave everything to us. ~

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:27.830
So, shall we go?

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:28.580
Sure!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:30.580
Well then...

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.970
Mota-san! Motamota-san!

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:34.000
Good afternoon!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.010
Oh my...

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:37.460
What's wrong...?

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:41.210
Do ya hafta ask? We're here fer our level 7 exam!

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.800
Eeh...? Is it today...?

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:49.390
That's a problem... We're just about to go out to travel...

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.920
Travel?

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:53.890
We won a trip from the lottery...!

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.400
A three-day trip to a hot spring...!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.820
Then, what about our exam?

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.190
Whatever shall we do...

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:08.740
We're supposed to depart today, especially since we've already packed...

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:13.750
Don't joke around! After all the trouble we went through to come here for the exam!?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:20.290
Ah, and then... and then... you just have to go on a hot spring trip, huh?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.840
We must be the world's unluckiest pretty girls!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:30.760
Fine then...

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:33.240
How about this...?

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:36.560
Regarding your level 7 exam...

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.650
You three pass...!

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:44.650
Please hold out your porons...

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.310
Don't be so slow...

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:50.120
Like you're one to talk!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.590
From now on, you are level 7 apprentices...

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:10.480
Did we really get to level 7 just like that?

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:11.890
You sure did...

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:17.310
But, don't mention this to anyone...!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.140
See you...!

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.400
Yay!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.670
Lucky!

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:24.280
I can't believe Doremi-chan got it so easy this time.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:29.070
Well then, since we still have time, how about a little sightseeing around the Witch World?

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:31.030
Agreed! We're already here anyway.

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.660
There are so many interesting places here!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:38.620
But Majo Rika said there are many scary places here too.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:43.850
It's alright. Now that we're level 7 apprentices, we can solve anything with magic.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:45.500
Ah, let's go over there!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:54.140
Everything is so big in this forest. Look! Look at that flower!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.310
What a huge flower.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:02.020
I know! We should test out level 7 magic. Could you hold this for me?

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:02.900
O-Okay.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.540
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.370
I wish to talk to this flower!

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.340
Good afternoon, Mr. Flower.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.600
Good afternoon.

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:27.960
We did it!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.130
Mr. Flower, what's your name?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.390
Me? I'm called "Weak-Point Flower."

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.350
"Weak-Point Flower," huh?

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:37.140
"Weak-Point Flower?"

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:38.100
Yes.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.890
I'm gonna eat ya!

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.100
Doremi-chan, ya big idiot!

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.060
Of all the flowers, you had to pick on this "Weak-Point Flower!?"

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.110
But I didn't know!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.820
Doremi-chan, grab on!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.630
Aah, we're safe...

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.160
Oh, is that stage coach...?

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.000
The Queen's carriage!

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.250
Majo Rin, stop the carriage!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.090
Yes, your Majesty.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:18.640
The reason you are here... was to take the apprentice exam?

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:19.600
Y-Yes.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:21.560
And the result is?

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.060
We all passed!

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:24.980
That's wonderful.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.860
We were very lucky. Mota and Motamota...

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:31.490
Idiot! She said not to tell anyone!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:32.320
Oops...

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.280
Is something the matter?

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.740
N-Nothing at all. Please excuse...

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.280
...us!!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.250
They were acting a tad strange, weren't they?

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:47.170
Majo Rin, when we get back to the castle, follow them with my crystal ball.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.210
Yes, your Majesty.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:56.390
Hadzuki-chan, good morning!

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.310
Doremi-chan, Ai-chan, good morning!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.060
What's wrong? What's with the sighin' so early in the morning?

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:07.650
If Nanako-chan doesn't arrive soon, I will have to take care of the animals myself.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.570
I wonder if she overslept...

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.860
But Nanako-chan is in the classroom.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.740
I saw her arrangin' some flowers too.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:18.870
I'm sorry.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:25.370
But I hate animals. I'm sorry but could you take care of them for me, Hadzuki-chan?

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:29.380
I can't do that! Even if you hate them, it's still your turn!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.840
Right, right!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:31.920
I won't do it!

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:32.840
Nanako-chan!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.380
I'm gonna tell Seki-sensei!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.050
But...

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:46.020
The fact that she brought flowers means she's a good kid. This is weird.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.440
Yeah...

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:51.190
I've known Nanako-chan since we were in the first grade...

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.990
Something bad must have recently happened to her...

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.360
Something happened alright.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:01.080
Let's check it out during lunch time.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:05.910
Okay, let's go!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.500
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:13.420
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:17.510
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.390
Magical Stage!

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:31.810
Tell us why Nanako-chan hates animals!

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:40.990
It's a map.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.950
It looks like a map of Misora City. What could it mean?

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.340
If we follow the arrow...

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:51.550
Maybe we'll learn why Nanako-chan hates animals.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:52.670
You're right. Let's go!

00:10:59.090 --> 00:10:59.630
Here's the place.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:01.980
Okada?

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:03.760
What? It's Nanako-chan's house.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.970
Are we supposed to ask her family?

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:10.360
This is stupid! We didn't hafta use Magical Stage if all we had to do was ask 'em!

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:12.650
But her family must know why.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:17.530
Jeez!

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:18.610
What is it?

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.610
We're still wearin' these outfits!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:21.950
Y-you're right.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:26.910
I wonder...

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.710
Don't look like anyone's home.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.670
Then we can't ask why she hates animals.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:43.390
No worries. We can use magic to talk to plants.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.470
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:51.230
I wish to talk to the sakura tree.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:12:00.650
Hey, Ms. Sakura Tree, please tell us.

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.660
Why does Nanako-chan hate animals?

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.320
Well...

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:10.580
It happened two years ago when her cute puppy got into an accident.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:41.290
Nanako-chan got that puppy on her fifth birthday from her parents.

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:42.570
It was very cute.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.490
Lulu's House

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.520
I'm gonna call you Lulu!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.580
I think she likes it!

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:58.080
In the rain, in the snow, Nanako-chan always played with her.

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:02.920
They were always together. But one summer two years ago...

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.090
Lulu, I'm gonna throw it over there now!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.050
No, don't jump, Lulu!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.270
Lulu!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:17.770
Nanako felt so responsible that she cried and didn't eat for three days and three nights.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.900
I don't blame her, fer losin' someone that close.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:27.610
Her worried parents offered to buy another, but Nanako-chan always refused.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:32.160
From then on, this house never bought another pet.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:35.120
I think I understand how Nanako-chan feels...

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:39.380
It must have broken her heart when Lulu died.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.840
Lunch time is over! The bell's already chiming!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.880
Let's hurry back!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.550
Thank you, Ms. Cherry Tree!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:48.070
You fell asleep on the rooftop?

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:48.550
Yes.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:52.350
You've got some guts skipping my lessons.

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:53.970
Then, you'll forgive us?

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.020
You're way too naïve. To the hall!

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:57.230
Yes, ma'am...

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:02.690
We should do something about Nanako-chan.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.390
Let's ask Seki-sensei.

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:08.990
She's still mad at us. Ya think that's a good idea?

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.870
Then how about asking Yuki-sensei?

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.870
I see.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.470
I have a good idea!

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:17.650
Really?

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:19.830
What is it? What is it? What is it?

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.790
This little one might have caught a cold.

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:29.590
She must not stay outside in her cage, so I brought her home to take care of her.

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:35.140
But my dad and I have to go somewhere, so I'll leave her with you, Nanako-chan.

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:38.850
I told you I hate animals. I can't!

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.520
Her name is Lulu.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:42.520
Lulu?

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.610
Anyway, please take care of her. Bye!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:48.320
Hadzuki-chan!

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:52.240
Jeez, that Hadzuki-chan...

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.080
Lulu, is it?

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.500
So I'm gonna look after you, okay?

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.300
Wow... You're really careless, aren't you?

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:19.690
Lulu?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:24.770
Lulu.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:29.740
I'm sorry for saying I wouldn't take care of you.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.280
Yuki-sensei's plan worked like a charm.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:33.280
Right, right.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.370
You shouldn't do that, Lulu!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:43.490
But I guess you wouldn't understand if I got mad at you...

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:46.840
I know! I'll build a cardboard house for you. Just you wait.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.310
Ehhh!? Lulu is missing!?

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:04.390
If she gets hurt, I... I...

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:07.020
Cryin' ain't gonna find her! Help us look!

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:08.980
I'll search with Nanako-chan.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.380
Got it! Ai-chan, let's search over here.

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:11.860
Alright!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.620
We'll search over there.

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:15.320
Yeah...

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:16.910
Lulu!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:17.950
Say somethin' if yer there!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.620
Lulu! Lulu!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.330
Lulu!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.460
Lulu!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.340
Did you find her!?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.010
No...

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:35.140
Nanako-chan, don't worry, we'll find her.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.850
Right, right, let's look fer her again!

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.480
Hey you!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:48.230
Lulu!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.650
Nanako-chan, hold on!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:55.610
She's still breathing!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:56.530
Let's take her to the hospital!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.540
Girls, what are you doing here?

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:06.750
Seki-sensei!

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:11.260
Ueno Veterinary

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:19.710
It's alright. Lulu will be fine.

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:21.180
Doctor, the bunny...

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.850
The bleeding has stopped. The surgery was a success.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:25.890
Is Lulu gonna be alright?

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:30.770
All we can do is wait. If she wakes up tonight, I think she'll be okay. But...

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:32.730
But if she doesn't...

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.190
Well...

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:40.280
Hadzuki-chan, you shouldn't have given Lulu to me!

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:43.330
Fujiwara didn't do anything wrong.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:49.380
I heard from Yuki-sensei. Fujiwara only tried to cure your hatred of animals.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.590
She didn't have to do that!

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:56.430
I thought I wouldn't have to see any more pets die!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.680
Hadzuki-chan!

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.910
I'll take care of Nanako-chan. Go after her.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:05.350
Yes ma'am!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.310
Hadzuki-chan!

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.270
Where are ya!?

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:09.970
Found her?

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:10.560
Not yet.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.730
Hadzuki-chan!

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:19.300
Hadzuki-chan, what're ya plannin' dressed like that!?

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:20.570
Let me go, both of you!

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:24.080
Ahh, don'tcha tell me yer gonna heal the bunny with magic?

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:29.540
All I do is get in the way. Now Nanako-chan will be even more hurt and it's all my fault!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:33.500
You can't! If you use magic to heal someone, you'll get the wound instead!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.470
What Majo Rika said would happen, might happen to ya!

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:41.970
If the bunny dies, Nanako-chan's heart will be shattered.

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:46.430
She'll hate animals even more. Please, let me go!

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.180
T-Then, let's do it together!

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:53.900
R-Right, if we do it together, the chance is three times higher!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.860
Doremi-chan, Ai-chan, thank you...

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:58.400
I'm so sorry!

00:18:59.030 --> 00:18:59.780
Hadzuki-chan!

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:06.290
Lulu!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:11.280
It'll be alright. If you care this much about her, I'm sure she'll be fine.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:12.750
Come on, let's rest.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:17.370
I don't want to get the others involved for my sake in this.

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:20.220
I don't care what will happen to me. So...

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:25.720
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:28.640
Please heal the bunny!

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:35.110
Please God, help Lulu.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:42.820
D-Doctor! The bunny... Doctor!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:43.450
W-W-What's going on?

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:44.320
What is it?

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:44.910
Lulu!?

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:46.860
She's...!

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:47.740
Lu-Lulu!

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:53.420
I-I can't believe it! It's a miracle! The wound is gone!

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:55.920
Seki-sensei!

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:59.340
I'm sure Heaven heard and answered your prayer, Okada.

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:03.090
That's great! That's great, Lulu!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:04.510
That's great.

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:10.140
Hadzuki-chan!

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.230
What happened!?

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.750
She's burning up! She has a fever!

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:16.020
Go get Seki-sensei!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:21.990
I've been sick since yesterday.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:24.420
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:27.590
But why is it only a cold?

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:31.770
In exchange for the bunny's life, Hadzuki should be near-death now.

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:35.220
That is because I used my magic to protect her.

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:36.000
Her Majesty!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:44.430
Yesterday, I just happened to be watching and noticed what you were up to.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.880
Don't ever do this again.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:49.420
It's as her Majesty says.

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:50.470
Hadzuki-chan.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:55.740
Don't ever use healing magic on someone or something that's near-death again.

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:56.880
Yeah...

00:20:56.880 --> 00:21:01.780
Breaking a law of the Witch World will not result in just a cold.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:06.570
You may not use magic at all from today until the middle of the month, alright?

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.030
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.590
Then, take care.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:20.840
Nanako-chan is here!

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:21.840
Oh no!

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.220
E-Everyone!

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.700
Looks like you're a lot better.

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.680
I'm sorry for what I said yesterday.

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:30.900
It's fine.

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:34.720
I'll do my part in taking care of the animals from now on, Hadzuki-chan.

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:35.890
Nanako-chan.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:40.360
Thanks to Hadzuki-chan, Nanako-chan likes animals again.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:41.780
That's great.

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:43.490
Here.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:44.320
How beautiful!

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:52.540
Hadzuki-chan, thank you so much. Get well soon.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:53.500
Yeah.

00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:02.610
Hadzuki-chan was kidnapped?

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:05.960
A scream of a little girl breaks the silence in the peaceful Misora City.

00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:06.600
Doremi-chan?

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:07.540
We gotta help her!

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:11.230
The enemies are the Papaya Brothers! We have to use magic to help her!

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:13.970
But the enemies have got something up their sleeves!

00:22:13.970 --> 00:22:15.700
A gun? That's cheating!

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:17.830
Don't worry about me! Run!

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:23.560
How can the Ojamajos save Hadzuki-chan from the Papaya Brothers?

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:24.440
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:26.570
Hadzuki-chan is Kidnapped!

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:28.900
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
